#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:7
#: 383569829aa34d938c600e1b2736b8d0
msgid ""
"This article shows how you can enable up to 6 autopilot control/flight modes"
" to be set from your RC transmitter via the flight mode channel "
"(:ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>` for plane/copter/sub, :ref:`MODE_CH<MODE_CH>`"
" for rover). Flight mode changes can also be made via RC channels setup as "
":ref:`common-auxiliary-functions`."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何通过飞行模式通道（Plane/Copter/Sub 使用 :ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>`，Rover 使用 "
":ref:`MODE_CH<MODE_CH>`）从遥控发射机设置最多 6 个飞控/飞行模式。飞行模式更改也可通过设置为 :ref:`common-"
"auxiliary-functions` 的 RC 通道进行。"

